  "source": "tools/map_scanner_generator/index.html",
  "viewHTML": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head> <meta charset=\"utf-8\" /> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" /> <title>Fantasy Map Location + Terrain Scanner</title> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body> <header class=\"topbar\"> <div> <h1>Fantasy Map Location + Terrain Scanner</h1> <p>Upload a fantasy map, import or draw location areas, classify terrain, create highlightable GeoJSON locations, generate immersive settlement data, attach NPCs, and export JSON/CSV/GeoJSON/HTML.</p> </div> <div class=\"pill\">HTML + CSS + JavaScript · Offline</div> </header> <main class=\"shell\"> <aside class=\"panel controls\"> <section> <h2>1. Load map</h2> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Map image <input id=\"mapFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" /> </label> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Area JSON / GeoJSON / exported scan JSON <input id=\"borderFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json,.geojson\" /> </label> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Settlement source JSON <input id=\"settlementJsonFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json\" /> </label> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"sampleBtn\" type=\"button\">Create sample map</button> <button id=\"clearBtn\" type=\"button\">Clear</button> </div> </section> <section> <h2>2. Location overlay areas</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Import polygons/GeoJSON, or draw one by clicking around the location area. Imported GeoJSON locations become hoverable and clickable. GeoJSON cells use 10 draggable white anchor dots plus a center map pin. Turn on “move cell” to drag the whole cell by its pin; leave it off to adjust anchors only. Overlay markers are never named on the image itself; clicked locations reveal names, details, NPCs, schedules, and intrigue in the immersive location/inspector section. Double-click or press “Close area”.</p> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"drawBorderBtn\" type=\"button\">Draw area</button> <button id=\"closeBorderBtn\" type=\"button\">Close area</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"deleteBorderBtn\" type=\"button\">Delete selected</button> <button id=\"fitBtn\" type=\"button\">Fit map</button> </div> <label>Selected area <select id=\"borderSelect\"></select> </label> <label>New area name <input id=\"borderName\" type=\"text\" value=\"Location Area 1\" /> </label> </section> <section> <h2>3. Coordinates + area scale</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Use longitude/latitude bounds for geographic area, or use a known total map/location area.</p> <div class=\"grid4\"> <label>West lon <input id=\"lonMin\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"-180\" /></label> <label>East lon <input id=\"lonMax\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"180\" /></label> <label>South lat <input id=\"latMin\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"-90\" /></label> <label>North lat <input id=\"latMax\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"90\" /></label> </div> <label>Known area for selected area or whole map (sq mi) <input id=\"knownSqMi\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"optional\" /> </label> <label>Known area applies to <select id=\"knownAreaMode\"> <option value=\"selected\">selected area</option> <option value=\"map\">entire image</option> </select> </label> </section> <section> <h2>4. Classifier</h2> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"autoPaletteBtn\" type=\"button\">Auto-pick map colors</button> <button id=\"scanBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"primary\">Scan + build clickable areas</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"promoteScanBtn\" type=\"button\">Convert scan to GeoJSON overlays</button> <button id=\"clearGeoJsonBtn\" type=\"button\">Clear GeoJSON overlays</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"exportSelectedGeoJsonBtn\" type=\"button\">Save selected GeoJSON</button> <button id=\"exportGeoBtn\" type=\"button\">Save replacement GeoJSON</button> </div> <label>Classification mode <select id=\"modeSelect\"> <option value=\"hybrid\">hybrid: trained colors + fantasy heuristics</option> <option value=\"palette\">trained / auto colors only</option> <option value=\"heuristic\">fantasy color heuristics only</option> </select> </label> <label>Minimum patch size in pixels <input id=\"minPatch\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" value=\"60\" /> </label> <label>Color tolerance <input id=\"tolerance\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"120\" value=\"44\" /> </label> <div id=\"legendEditor\" class=\"legendEditor\"></div> <button id=\"addClassBtn\" type=\"button\">Add custom class</button> <p class=\"hint\">Tip: click a class swatch, then click the map to train that class from the exact map color.</p> </section> <section> <h2>5. Export</h2> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"exportJsonBtn\" type=\"button\">Export JSON</button> <button id=\"exportCsvBtn\" type=\"button\">Export CSV</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"savePngBtn\" type=\"button\">Save overlay PNG</button> </div> </section> <section class=\"lore-generator-section\"> <h2>6. the source world Canon Lore Expansion</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Imported canon data from the alignment guide, pantheon, world lore, unified campaign summary, time conversion guide, and night sky document. Use this to enrich every generated settlement location without removing existing scanner behavior.</p> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"applyLoreExpansionBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"primary\">Apply lore to all locations</button> <button id=\"exportLoreJsonBtn\" type=\"button\">Export lore corpus JSON</button> </div> <label>Search imported lore corpus <input id=\"loreSearchInput\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search gods, races, death ledger, ichor, moons, alignment, time...\" /> </label> <div id=\"loreSearchResults\" class=\"status\">Search the imported lore corpus.</div> </section> <section class=\"name-generator-section\"> <h2>7. Settlement NPC Name Generator</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Generate settlement NPCs from the settlement JSON. The JSON now drives races, region and settlement name, settlement type, government, danger, intrigue and rumors, visitor alignment expectations, tags, religions, economy, culture, geography, visitable location counts, named NPC counts, schedules, relationships, and exported location panels.</p> <div id=\"source_world-name-generator-panel\" data-source_world-name-generator> <div class=\"bng-json-tools\"> <label for=\"bngJsonInput\">Settlement / NPC JSON</label> <textarea id=\"bngJsonInput\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea> <div class=\"grid4\"> <label>Fallback NPC Count <input type=\"number\" id=\"bngNpcCount\" min=\"1\" max=\"5000\" value=\"25\" /> </label> <label>Surname Style <select id=\"bngSurnameMode\"> <option value=\"category\">Category-based</option> <option value=\"race\">Race-flavored</option> <option value=\"mixed\">Mixed fantasy</option> </select> </label> </div> <label class=\"check stack-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bngTitles\" /> Add occasional steampunk-dark-fantasy honorifics</label> <label class=\"check stack-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bngFantasyMarks\" checked /> Allow apostrophes, hyphens, and accents</label> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"bngGenerate\" type=\"button\" class=\"primary\">Generate NPCs</button> <button id=\"bngClear\" type=\"button\">Clear NPCs</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"bngCopyJson\" type=\"button\">Copy NPC JSON</button> <button id=\"bngDownloadJson\" type=\"button\">Download NPC JSON</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"assignNpcsSelectedBtn\" type=\"button\">Attach to selected location</button> <button id=\"assignNpcsAllBtn\" type=\"button\">Distribute to all locations</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"generateImmersiveSelectedBtn\" type=\"button\">Generate selected location</button> <button id=\"generateImmersiveAllBtn\" type=\"button\">Generate all locations</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"refreshVisitorsBtn\" type=\"button\">Refresh current visitors</button> <button id=\"exportInteractiveHtmlBtn\" type=\"button\">Export interactive HTML</button> </div> <button id=\"generateFullSettlementBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"primary\">Auto-fill full settlement from JSON</button> <button id=\"exportMergedSettlementBtn\" type=\"button\">Export full settlement generator JSON</button> <div class=\"status\" id=\"bngStatus\"></div> <label for=\"bngFilter\">Filter generated NPCs</label> <input id=\"bngFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Filter NPC names, races, pronouns...\" /> <div class=\"mini\" id=\"bngResultCount\">No NPCs generated yet.</div> <div id=\"bngResults\" class=\"bng-results\"></div> </div> </div> </section> </aside> <section class=\"workspace\"> <div class=\"toolbar\"> <button id=\"zoomOutBtn\" type=\"button\">−</button> <input id=\"zoomSlider\" type=\"range\" min=\"25\" max=\"300\" value=\"100\" /> <button id=\"zoomInBtn\" type=\"button\">+</button> <button id=\"panModeBtn\" type=\"button\">Pan</button> <button id=\"inspectBtn\" type=\"button\">Inspect</button> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showMask\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> overlay</label> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showGeoJSON\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> GeoJSON highlights</label> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"moveCellToggle\" type=\"checkbox\" /> move cell</label> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showBorders\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> areas</label> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showLabels\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> scan type labels</label> </div> <div id=\"canvasWrap\" class=\"canvasWrap\"> <canvas id=\"mapCanvas\"></canvas> <canvas id=\"overlayCanvas\"></canvas> <svg id=\"geoJsonOverlaySvg\" class=\"geoJsonOverlaySvg\" aria-label=\"Clickable GeoJSON settlement locations\"></svg> </div> </section> <aside class=\"panel results\"> <section> <h2>Scan summary</h2> <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\">Load a map to begin.</div> <div id=\"totals\" class=\"totals\"></div> </section> <section> <h2>Detected areas</h2> <div id=\"tableWrap\" class=\"tableWrap\"></div> </section> <section> <h2>Immersive location inspector</h2> <pre id=\"inspector\">Click a GeoJSON overlay marker to show the location name, details, NPCs, visitors, schedules, and intrigue here. Names are never printed on the map image itself.</pre> </section> </aside> </main> <template id=\"classTemplate\"> <div class=\"classRow\"> <button class=\"swatch\" type=\"button\" title=\"Click, then click the map to sample\"></button> <input class=\"className\" type=\"text\" /> <select class=\"classType\"> <option>water</option><option>river</option><option>lake</option><option>coast</option><option>reef</option> <option>forest</option><option>mountain</option><option>hill</option><option>valley</option><option>plateau</option> <option>desert</option><option>canyon</option><option>island</option><option>delta</option><option>marsh</option> <option>grassland</option><option>tundra</option><option>snow</option><option>urban</option><option>unknown</option> </select> <input class=\"classColor\" type=\"color\" /> <button class=\"removeClass\" type=\"button\">×</button> </div> </template> <script src=\"name_generator.js\"></script> <script src=\"source_world_lore_data.js\"></script> <script> document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function(){ if (window.the source worldNameGenerator) { window.the source worldNameGenerator.init(\"#source_world-name-generator-panel\"); } }); </script> <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>"
}